    "Are you interested in contributing but don’t know where to start? Head over to the <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" href=\"https://www.collaboraoffice.org/post/build-code/\">step-by-step instructions</a> and build CODE from scratch. You can also help out with <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" href=\"https://www.collaboraoffice.org/post/translate/\">translations</a> or by <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" href=\"https://www.collaboraoffice.org/post/filebugs/\">filing a bug report</a> with all the essential steps on how to reproduce it.": "Har du lyst til å bidra, men veit ikkje kvar du skal byrja? Sjå <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" href=\"https://www.collaboraoffice.org/post/build-code/\">steg-for-steg-rettleiinga</a> og bygg CODE frå grunnen av. Du kan òg hjelpa til med <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" href=\"https://www.collaboraoffice.org/post/translate/\">omsetjing</a> eller ved å <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" href=\"https://www.collaboraoffice.org/post/filebugs/\">melda ein feil</a> med alle stega som trengst for å gjenskapa han.",
