    "If no whole cell is selected and the cursor is at the end of the table, the paragraph following the table will be deleted, unless it is the last paragraph in the document.": "若未選取整個儲存格，且游標位在表格結尾，則表格後方接續的段落會被刪除，除非該段落是文件的最後一段。",
